     "order": 6,
     "attributes": {
      "subject": "I hope you're well {{contact.first_name}} 😊",
      "from_email": "{{location.email}}",
      "from_name": "{{custom_values.sales_and_journey}}",
      "attachments": [],
      "html": "<p style=\"margin:0px;font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;font-size:16px; padding-left: 0px!important;margin: 0px;font-family: verdana,geneva,sans-serif;font-size: 16px;\">Hi {{contact.first_name}}</p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;font-size:16px; padding-left: 0px!important;margin: 0px;font-family: verdana,geneva,sans-serif;font-size: 16px;\">It's been about 3 months since you finished with us, so I just wanted to make sure you're still taking good care of your health.</p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;font-size:16px; padding-left: 0px!important;margin: 0px;font-family: verdana,geneva,sans-serif;font-size: 16px;\">The offer of some free classes is still there if you want to get moving again and feel ready?<br><br>What do you think?</p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;font-size:16px; padding-left: 0px!important;margin: 0px;font-family: verdana,geneva,sans-serif;font-size: 16px;\">Nick</p>",
